  "Browse 10 collections, their books and individual narrations. Arabic text, available translations and source references stay close at hand.": "Jelajahi 10 koleksi, kitab, dan riwayatnya. Teks Arab, terjemahan yang tersedia, dan rujukan sumber tetap mudah diakses.",
